      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(usage-bar): evict oldest template cache entry when full",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\nThe module-level `fileCache` Map grew unbounded — each entry held a live `fs.watch` watcher that was never closed (only `clearUsageBarTemplateCacheForTest()` cleaned them).\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\nAdd `MAX_CACHED_TEMPLATES = 32`. When filling, evict the oldest entry and close its watcher before inserting.\n\n## User Impact\nPrevents unbounded watcher/memory growth when usage bar templates are loaded from changing file paths.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-98853-proof.png)\n- `translator.test.ts`: 13/13 passed ✅",
